### Project Title

Smart Classroom Attendance System Using Face Detection

**Problem Statement**

Taking attendance manually consumes valuable classroom time and is prone to errors. A system is needed to automatically record student attendance.

**Proposed Solution**

A camera installed in the classroom captures live video. The system detects and recognizes student faces and automatically records attendance in a database.
